WEBVTT - What Resurgenix Can Do

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.000
Most organizations already have hundreds of cameras.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.500
But cameras only record. Someone has to be watching at exactly the right moment.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.500
Your cameras already see.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.500
Resurgenix adds an AI layer on top of the cameras you already have.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.500
It detects people, vehicles, and restricted-zone entries in real time.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.500
The right person is alerted, with the evidence, at the right moment.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:50.000
From factories and warehouses to hospitals and cities.

00:00:50.500 --> 00:01:00.000
Your cameras already see. Resurgenix helps them understand. Dekhe bhi, samjhe bhi.

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:06.000
Illustrative visualization. Actual deployments depend on site assessment.
